  "label": "Big Bird is mapped as Snuffy in the text",
  "description": "The top text 'Snuffy and Big Bird discuss...' explicitly names both characters. The visual material shows only Big Bird (the large yellow bird costume), while Snuffy is not visually present. The text implies that the person in the Big Bird costume is being mapped to the character Snuffy, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Big Bird) is being identified as Snuffy by the textual material. This is a case of textual identification projecting onto a visual entity.",
